abstract: >
  An open-source, practitioner-focused framework for operationalizing AI cyber risk
  management in enterprise environments. Comprises three pillars: AI Definitions &
  Taxonomy (112+ terms, 8 categories), AI Risk Taxonomy (187+ risks, 14 categories),
  and AI Control Framework (200+ sub-controls, 25 domains).
